The fact it is so in certain natural languages doesn't mean we should do it
this way in *lojba**n *!

On Wed, Sep 9, 2009 at 1:48 AM, tijlan <jbotijlan@gmail.com> wrote:

> 2009/9/8 komfo,amonan <komfoamonan@gmail.com>:
> > On Tue, Sep 8, 2009 at 4:42 PM, Ivo Doko <ivo.doko@gmail.com> wrote:
